data: {"type":"tool-input-available","toolCallId":"hcall_3_4b908b1f-c8c6-4f71-a4c9-1cda5955323b","toolName":"vendo_apps_create","input":{"prompt":"Build the simplest possible app: a single list of my transactions, and nothing else. No charts, no stats, no tabs, no extra sections — just one list.\n\nThe list is bound to my live transactions (the Search transactions tool / host_listTransactions), sorted most recent first. Each row shows the transaction's merchant/description, its date, its category, and its amount. Preserve currency formatting and integer-cent semantics for the amounts. If there are no transactions, let the list show its own empty state.\n\nInherit the host theme — no custom fonts, colors, or branding. Name the app \"Transactions\"."},"dynamic":true}

