data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"txt_2_b117d10e-015c-4921-84e6-567a3e7cf0cd","delta":"I wasn't able to build the app right now — the app builder itself is failing on every attempt, and it's failing before it produces anything, so there's nothing to open yet. This looks like a temporary problem on Maple's side rather than anything about your request; your transactions themselves are loading fine.\n\nThe app you asked for is simple and ready to go the moment the builder is back — just a plain list of your transactions, newest first, showing the merchant, date, category, and amount. Want me to try again in a little while?"}

data: {"type":"text-end","id":"txt_2_b117d10e-015c-4921-84e6-567a3e7cf0cd"}

